WEBVTT

00:30.401 --> 00:40.565
The world fell grey A missing piece

00:41.085 --> 00:46.207
A quiet, slow and sad release

00:48.443 --> 00:55.366
A chapter closed A best friend gone Just trying

00:55.727 --> 01:00.109
to find a way to carry

01:02.730 --> 01:11.754
on The days were long, the colors faded A little

01:11.814 --> 01:14.155
lost and worn and jaded

01:18.029 --> 01:25.674
Then you walked in and caught my eye Beneath the

01:25.714 --> 01:28.495
dull community college sky

02:09.295 --> 02:09.855
Yes. Yes.

02:13.523 --> 02:22.125
You talk of dreams and taking flight Of leaving

02:22.365 --> 02:25.866
all the dark for light

02:28.326 --> 02:36.468
You say you see the real me there A kindred soul

02:36.528 --> 02:39.429
beyond compare

02:45.068 --> 02:50.571
It feels so fast. It feels so right.

02:53.612 --> 02:59.335
A sudden stop in my dark night.

03:00.956 --> 03:08.159
You fill the void. You bridge the gap. A perfect

03:08.219 --> 03:09.100
escape.

03:14.118 --> 03:23.314
I see a new light in your lonely room But there's a

03:23.374 --> 03:26.620
shadow chasing after you

03:30.083 --> 03:37.007
You see a fast car on an open road I see a heavy,

03:37.047 --> 03:42.871
heavy load

03:43.111 --> 03:47.034
And for the first time in a long, long while

04:07.203 --> 04:12.065
And you're a new light in a lonely room

04:14.685 --> 04:19.427
Chasing away the coming bloom

04:22.107 --> 04:28.849
You're a fast car on an open road Lifting off a

04:28.869 --> 04:29.569
heavy load

04:34.904 --> 04:41.309
And for the first time in a long, long while, a new

04:41.369 --> 04:51.937
life. Oh, my dear brother, please be smart.

04:51.977 --> 04:57.742
This new life's going to break your heart. It's

04:57.862 --> 04:59.003
going to break your heart.

